      "AMANDA: Lynn, hey.\nLYNN: Sorry I'm late. You'll never believe the morning I'm having.\nAMANDA: No worries. Everything's going pretty hokay. OOPS still hasn't delivered two of the pieces, but everything else is here.\nLYNN: Phil around?",
      "AMANDA: Ass kisser.\nLYNN: Well, thanks. It means a lot to me.",
      "LYNN: How...on earth...did you get all these people here?\nAMANDA: WWW dot I hate clowns dot com. I posted it on their message board.\nLYNN: But...if they hate clowns, why would they come?\nAMANDA: It's a love-hate thing.",
      "AMANDA: Twenty thousand dollars...that'll buy a lot of bandwidth.\nAMANDA: Tres geek, huh?\nLYNN: Yeah.",
      "LYNN: I'm sorry. I don't even know where to start.\nAMANDA: What? What happened?\nLYNN: You'll never believe it...get me some coffee and I'll tell you about it."
    ]
